{
  "id": "dev-decoder",
  "language": "rust",
  "kind": "existing",
  "split": "development",
  "title": "Percent decoding",
  "trigger": "active_check",
  "requirements": [
    "data 是 ASCII 字符串。把合法 %HH 十六进制字节解码，输出有效 UTF-8 字符串；无效转义或无效 UTF-8 返回 {error:invalid}。",
    "初始规则把 + 转为空格；修复无效转义被当成普通文本保留的问题。"
  ],
  "correction": "+ 改为保持字面加号，其余解码规则不变。 调用者已更新 verify.py；不要修改该文件，保留其余要求和 NOTES.txt。",
  "notes": "Caller notes for dev-decoder: preserve this file byte for byte.\n",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "encoded",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "A%20B"
      },
      "expected": "A B",
      "public": true
    },
    {
      "id": "utf8",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "%E4%B8%AD"
      },
      "expected": "中",
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "plus",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "A+B"
      },
      "expected": "A+B",
      "public": true,
      "before": "A B"
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "%2B+"
      },
      "expected": "++",
      "public": false,
      "before": "+ "
    },
    {
      "id": "invalid",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "%Q0"
      },
      "expected": {
        "error": "invalid"
      },
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "short",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "%"
      },
      "expected": {
        "error": "invalid"
      },
      "public": false
    }
  ]
}
